    {
      "title": "Сменить режим — только явно",
      "text": "`opaque` скрывает из сигналов имена классов и квартир, `none` выключает сигналы совсем — для пула в режиме транзакций (PgBouncer), где база не может их доставить: подписки тогда опрашивают журнал, а кэш работает только по сроку. После смены режима процессы приложения перезапускают: режим читается при подключении.",
      "code": "const mode = async () => (await admin.unsafe(`select \"${schema}\".signal_mode() as mode`))[0].mode;\nawait setup(ADMIN_DSN, name, { signals: 'opaque', quiet: true });\nconst opaque = await mode();\nawait setup(ADMIN_DSN, name, { signals: 'none', quiet: true });\nreturn { opaque, none: await mode() };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> admin.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\".signal_mode() as mode`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].mode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ADMIN_DSN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name, { signals: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'opaque'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quiet: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> opaque</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ADMIN_DSN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name, { signals: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quiet: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { opaque, none: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span></code></pre>",
